        "body": "_:warning: Potential issue_\n\n**That's a negative on the URL override, chief.**\n\nThe current example shows converting SSH URLs to HTTPS, which is the opposite of our mission objective. Let's flip that around like a gravitational slingshot maneuver.\n\n\n```diff\n     # ~/.partcad/config.yaml\n     import:\n       overrides:\n         url:\n-          \"git@github.com:\": \"https://github.com/\"\n+          \"https://github.com/\": \"git@github.com:\"\n```\n\n\n<!-- suggestion_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Committable suggestion</summary>\n\n> ‼️ **IMPORTANT**\n> Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.\n\n`````suggestion\n    # ~/.partcad/config.yaml\n    import:\n      overrides:\n        url:\n          \"https://github.com/\": \"git@github.com:\"\n`````\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- suggestion_end -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->",
